// RUN: toyc --help | filecheck %s

// `--help` shows the compiler's own description, a usage line named after the compiler, the flags
// of the driver, and the flags of each registered stage under a heading of its own.

// CHECK:      Compiles calc, a toy language, for two toy stack machines
// CHECK:      Usage: toyc [OPTIONS] [INPUT]...
// CHECK:      --target <TRIPLE>
// CHECK:      --stop-after <NAME>
// CHECK:      calc frontend options:
// CHECK-NEXT:       --wrap-on-overflow
// CHECK:      stackvm backend options:
// CHECK-NEXT:       --stackvm-comments
